<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Dor Relatada do Setor Jurídico | Solicitação de Parecer Jurídico | SENAI & DESKTOP</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Apresentação executiva interativa - Projeto de Conclusão de Curso (Técnico em Administração, SENAI) sobre a otimização do fluxo de solicitação de parecer jurídico da DESKTOP com IA e automação.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFCC14">

  <!-- Open Graph / Meta -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="Dor Relatada do Setor Jurídico | Solicitação de Parecer Jurídico | SENAI & DESKTOP">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Apresentação em slides horizontais interativos com diagnóstico SLA, Ishikawa, fluxos AS IS / TO BE e proposta de IA.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="assets/desktop-logo.jpg">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/desktop-logo.jpg">

  <!-- Google Fonts: Sora (Headings) & DM Sans (Body) -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- Lucide Icons -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <!-- GSAP CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>

  <style>
    /* ==========================================================================
       1. VARIÁVEIS CSS E DESIGN SYSTEM (TEMA VERMELHO DESKTOP BASE & TEMA VINHO)
       ========================================================================== */
    :root {
      --bg-0: #7A010C;
      --bg-1: #8C020E;
      --bg-2: #650008;
      --bg-3: #520006;
      --bg-card: rgba(85, 3, 10, 0.72);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(115, 5, 15, 0.88);
      --yellow: #FFD43B;
      --gold: #FFC107;
      --red-dark: #3F0005;
      --red-alert: #FF4D4D;
      --text-1: #FFFFFF;
      --text-2: #FCE8E8;
      --text-muted: #E5B4B4;
      --line: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.28);
      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      --border-gold: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.45);
      --glow-gold: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
      --glow-red: 0 0 25px rgba(235, 36, 26, 0.35);
      
      --font-heading: 'Sora', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      --ease-power: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
      --transition-smooth: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
      --header-height: 56px;
      --nav-bar-height: 70px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #500007;
      background: linear-gradient(108deg, #500007 0%, #68010B 22%, #85020E 45%, #B30816 72%, #D8131A 92%, #EB241A 100%);
      color: var(--text-1);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      user-select: none;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      transition: background 0.5s ease;
    }

    /* Acessibilidade de foco */
    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--yellow);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    /* Scrollbar personalizada para áreas com rolagem interna */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: rgba(255,204,20,0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: var(--yellow);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
    .custom-cursor, .custom-cursor-dot {
      display: none !important;
    }

    /* Canvas de partículas douradas sutis */
    #ambient-canvas {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.55;
    }

    /* Camada de fundo global (Gradiente + Linhas Topográficas + Marca d'água 'Y') */
    .global-ambient-layer {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .ambient-radial-glow {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20%;
      left: -15%;
      width: 75vw;
      height: 75vh;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 0%, rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.02) 40%, transparent 70%);
      filter: blur(80px);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       3. ESTRUTURA GERAL DOS SLIDES (HORIZONTAL SLIDER)
       ========================================================================== */
    .presentation-viewport {
      position: relative;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100dvh;
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .slides-track {
      display: flex;
      width: 1800vw; /* 18 slides x 100vw */
      height: 100%;
      will-change: transform;
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      transition: transform 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
    }

    .slide {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100dvh;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: clamp(1.2rem, 3.5vw, 4rem);
      padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2.2rem);
      padding-bottom: calc(var(--nav-bar-height) + 1rem);
      box-sizing: border-box;
      overflow-y: auto;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      opacity: 0.15;
      transform: scale(0.97);
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
    }

    .slide.is-active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }

    /* Container de conteúdo dentro de cada slide */
    .slide-content-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1440px;
      margin: auto auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 5;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-top: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       4. CABEÇALHOS, BARRA DE NAVEGAÇÃO E CONTROLES DE INTERFACE
       ========================================================================== */
    /* Barra Superior */
    .top-bar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: var(--header-height);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .top-progress-bar {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 3px;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--yellow));
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--yellow);
      transition: width 0.4s ease;
      z-index: 102;
    }

    .brand-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-2);
    }

    .brand-logo-img {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      object-fit: cover;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.45);
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .brand-meta .badge {
      background: rgba(255,204,20,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,204,20,0.4);
      color: var(--yellow);
      padding: 3px 9px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .top-controls {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn-icon {
      background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-1);
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .btn-icon:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.15);
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Contador do Slide "03 / 12" */
    .slide-counter {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--text-1);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      background: rgba(20,20,20,0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .slide-counter .current-num {
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    /* Barra Inferior de Navegação & Dots */
    .bottom-bar {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: var(--nav-bar-height);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.9) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .bottom-bar > * {
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .nav-hints {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    .nav-hint-key {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--text-2);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-family: monospace;
    }

    /* Dots Centralizados */
    .dots-container {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(14, 14, 14, 0.75);
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .nav-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
      position: relative;
    }
    .nav-dot:hover {
      background: var(--yellow);
      transform: scale(1.4);
    }
    .nav-dot.is-active {
      width: 26px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.5);
    }

    /* Tooltip do Dot */
    .nav-dot .dot-tooltip {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: calc(100% + 12px);
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(5px);
      background: #111;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
      color: var(--text-1);
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
    }
    .nav-dot:hover .dot-tooltip {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    }

    /* Botões Flutuantes de Navegação (Setas Laterais) */
    .nav-arrow-btn {
      position: fixed;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(28,28,28,0.85) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.85) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.22);
      color: var(--yellow);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 90;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .nav-arrow-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(40,40,40,0.95) 0%, rgba(18,18,18,0.95) 100%);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.08);
    }
    .nav-arrow-btn.prev { left: 24px; }
    .nav-arrow-btn.next { right: 24px; }
    .nav-arrow-btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav-arrow-btn { display: none; }
      .nav-hints { display: none; }
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       5. COMPONENTES REUTILIZÁVEIS: TÍTULOS, LINHAS, CARDS, CHIPS
       ========================================================================== */
    .title-large {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.8vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .title-medium {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.9rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .title-small {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .highlight-yellow {
      color: var(--yellow) !important;
    }
    .highlight-gold {
      color: var(--gold) !important;
    }
    .highlight-red {
      color: var(--red-alert) !important;
    }

    /* Linha divisória amarela com início grosso (marca registrada da apresentação) */
    .brand-divider-line {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 650px;
      height: 3px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      margin: 0.9rem 0 1.5rem 0;
      border-radius: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .brand-divider-line::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: -2px;
      width: 90px;
      height: 7px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--yellow);
    }

    /* Cards com Glassmorphism e Efeito de Borda Dourada */
    .premium-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 2rem);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .premium-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,204,20,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
      -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
      -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
      mask-composite: exclude;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .premium-card:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), var(--glow-gold);
    }

    /* Imagens temáticas com fallback */
    .theme-image-bg {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 45%;
      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      opacity: 0.22;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 70%);
      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 70%);
    }
    .theme-image-bg img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: grayscale(1) brightness(0.45) contrast(1.15);
      transition: transform 1.2s ease;
    }
    .slide:hover .theme-image-bg img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    /* Chips e Tags */
    .badge-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: var(--text-2);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .badge-chip:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--yellow);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       6. SLIDES ESPECÍFICOS (1 A 12)
       ========================================================================== */

    /* --- SLIDE 1: CAPA --- */
    .slide-1 .slide-content-container {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .slide-1 .cover-wrap {
      max-width: 1100px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .slide-1 .top-sub {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .slide-1 .main-pcc {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.5vw, 5.2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .slide-1 .brand-divider-line {
      margin: 1.5rem auto;
    }
    .slide-1 .brand-divider-line::before {
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
    .slide-1 .subtitle-problem {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      line-height: 1.15;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .slide-1 .subtitle-desc {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      color: var(--text-2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .slide-1 .scroll-hint {
      margin-top: 2.8rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.25);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .slide-1 .scroll-hint:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.2);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .slide-1 .pulse-arrow {
      animation: bounceX 4.5s infinite ease-in-out;
      color: var(--yellow);
    }
    @keyframes bounceX {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
      50% { transform: translateX(4px); }
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 2: QUEM SOMOS --- */
    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
    .hex-member-card {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bg-2);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px 18px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .hex-member-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(0.8deg);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .hex-avatar-wrap {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      position: relative;
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 93% 25%, 93% 75%, 50% 100%, 7% 75%, 7% 25%);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--yellow), var(--gold));
      padding: 3px;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .hex-member-card:hover .hex-avatar-wrap {
      transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-2deg);
    }
    .hex-avatar-inner {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 93% 25%, 93% 75%, 50% 100%, 7% 75%, 7% 25%);
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hex-avatar-inner img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: grayscale(1) brightness(0.9);
      transition: filter 0.3s;
    }
    .hex-member-card:hover .hex-avatar-inner img {
      filter: grayscale(0) brightness(1.05);
    }
    .member-name {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .member-role {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .team-footer-quote {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem);
      color: var(--text-2);
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      background: rgba(255,204,20,0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,204,20,0.2);
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .team-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 3: INTRODUÇÃO --- */
    .intro-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
    .intro-card {
      padding: 32px 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .intro-card .icon-box {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3);
      color: var(--yellow);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

            /* --- SLIDE 9: PROPOSTA IMPLEMENTAÇÕES NO LECOM --- */
    .lecom-props-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 1.6rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .lecom-props-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .lecom-prop-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .lecom-prop-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .lecom-prop-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 5px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--yellow);
    }
    .lecom-prop-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .lecom-prop-header {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255,212,59,0.25);
    }
    .lecom-prop-num {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .lecom-prop-header h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.4vw, 1.4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .lecom-prop-card p {
      color: #D6D6D6;
      font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.2vw, 1.18rem);
      line-height: 1.7;
      flex: 1;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .lecom-prop-card p {
      color: #F8E2E2;
    }
    .lecom-prop-footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 10: VÍDEO DEMONSTRAÇÃO EM TELA CHEIA --- */
    .video-slide-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .video-player-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      height: 64vh;
      background: #000;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), var(--glow-gold);
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .video-player-wrap video {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      background: #000;
    }
    .video-top-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE NOVO: MAPEAMENTO E DIAGNÓSTICO DOS PROCESSOS --- */
    .mapping-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .mapping-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    .mapping-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 30px);
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .mapping-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 5px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }
    .mapping-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .mapping-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .mapping-icon-wrap {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.28);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: var(--yellow);
    }
    .mapping-card-content h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.4vw, 1.35rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .mapping-card-content p {
      color: #D1D1D1;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.15vw, 1.18rem);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 4: DOR RELATADA --- */
    .problem-highlight-box {
      background: rgba(20,20,20,0.85);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--text-1);
    }
    /* Efeito de marca-texto animado */
    .marker-highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,204,20,0.25) 0%, rgba(255,204,20,0.35) 100%);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFF;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,204,20,0.2);
    }
    .problem-chips-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

        /* --- TABELA E GRÁFICO COMPARATIVO: QUADRO 1 & FIGURA 1 --- */
    .quadro-indicadores-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .quadro-indicadores-table th {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .quadro-indicadores-table th {
      background: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.22);
      color: #FFF;
    }
    .quadro-indicadores-table td {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-1);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.4);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .quadro-indicadores-table td {
      background: rgba(60, 2, 7, 0.45);
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }
    .quadro-indicadores-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .quadro-indicadores-table tr:hover td {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.06);
    }
    .table-val-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .table-val-badge.val-red {
      color: var(--red-alert);
    }
    .table-val-badge.val-yellow {
      color: var(--yellow);
    }
    .table-caption-sub {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 6px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .table-caption-sub {
      color: #F8CFCF;
    }

    /* Gráfico de Barras Horizontais Fiel à Figura 1 */
    .figura-sla-bars {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0.8rem 0;
    }
    .bar-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .bar-label-tag {
      width: 65px;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-2);
      text-align: right;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .bar-track-area {
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 6px;
      height: 38px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .bar-fill-blue {
      height: 100%;
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1E6B9E, #2A83BE);
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding-right: 14px;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(30, 107, 158, 0.35);
      transition: width 1s ease-out;
    }
    .bar-fill-green {
      height: 100%;
      width: 25%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #168058, #20A775);
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding-right: 14px;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(22, 128, 88, 0.35);
      transition: width 1s ease-out;
    }
    .bar-outside-val {
      margin-left: 14px;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #20A775;
    }
    .scale-ruler {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-left: 81px;
      padding-top: 6px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .scale-ruler {
      border-top-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3);
      color: #F8CFCF;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 5 & 7: DIAGNÓSTICO (SLA, RETRABALHO E FLUXO) --- */
    .diagnostic-split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .diagnostic-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* Barras de SLA Horizontal */
    .sla-bars-wrapper {
      margin: 20px 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .sla-bar-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .sla-bar-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .sla-track {
      height: 22px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
    .sla-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding-right: 10px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .sla-fill.current {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #600000, var(--red-alert));
      box-shadow: var(--glow-red);
    }
    .sla-fill.ideal {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #b08d0e, var(--yellow));
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }

    /* Rosca de Retrabalho (Donut Chart SVG) */
    .donut-chart-container {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .donut-svg-wrap {
      position: relative;
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .donut-svg-wrap svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
    }
    .donut-bg-circle {
      stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      stroke-width: 10;
      fill: none;
    }
    .donut-progress-circle {
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      stroke-width: 10;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      fill: none;
      transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .donut-center-label {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Fluxo Horizontal AS IS / TO BE */
    .flow-rail-container {
      margin-top: 24px;
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 12px 4px;
    }
    .flow-steps-rail {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      min-width: max-content;
    }
    .flow-step-card {
      background: var(--bg-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-1);
      position: relative;
    }
    .flow-step-card.bottleneck {
      background: rgba(128, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border-color: var(--red-alert);
      color: #fff;
      animation: pulseBottleneck 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    .flow-step-card.highlight-ai {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.15);
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    @keyframes pulseBottleneck {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,31,31,0.2); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255,31,31,0.5); border-color: #ff5252; }
    }
    .flow-arrow-animated {
      color: var(--yellow);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      opacity: 0.8;
      animation: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }

    /* Slide 7: Toggle de Dados (Levantamento Inicial vs Atualizado) */
    .data-toggle-bar {
      display: inline-flex;
      background: rgba(15,15,15,0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,204,20,0.3);
      padding: 4px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .data-toggle-btn {
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-2);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .data-toggle-btn.is-active {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.4);
    }

    /* Faixa de Alerta Principais Gargalos */
    .bottlenecks-alert-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(128, 0, 0, 0.7) 0%, rgba(221, 176, 21, 0.4) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 31, 31, 0.4);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px 22px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    #slide-8 {
      justify-content: center !important;
      padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 1rem) !important;
      padding-bottom: calc(var(--nav-bar-height) + 1rem) !important;
    }
    #slide-8 .slide-content-container {
      margin: auto auto !important;
    }
    .fishbone-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1380px;
      margin: 1rem auto 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }
    .fishbone-svg-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .fishbone-svg-wrap {
      background: rgba(75, 2, 8, 0.75);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3);
    }
    .fishbone-svg {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 58vh;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      overflow: visible;
    }

    /* Estilos dos ramos e elementos da espinha */
    .bone-spine {
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      stroke-width: 4;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.4));
    }
    .bone-branch {
      stroke: #888;
      stroke-width: 2.5;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      transition: stroke 0.3s, stroke-width 0.3s;
    }
    .bone-sub {
      stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      stroke-width: 1.5;
      stroke-linecap: round;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .bone-branch {
      stroke: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.6);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .bone-sub {
      stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    }

    .fishbone-cat-group {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, filter 0.3s ease;
    }
    .fishbone-cat-group:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.2);
    }
    .fishbone-cat-group:hover .bone-branch {
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      stroke-width: 3.5;
    }
    .fishbone-cat-group:hover .bone-cat-box {
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      fill: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.18);
    }
    .bone-cat-box {
      fill: #4A0108;
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      stroke-width: 2;
      rx: 8;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    body.theme-red .bone-cat-box {
      fill: #5E010A;
      stroke: var(--yellow);
    }
    body.theme-wine .bone-cat-box {
      fill: #3A060D !important;
      stroke: var(--yellow) !important;
    }
    .bone-cat-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      fill: #FFFFFF !important;
      text-anchor: middle;
      dominant-baseline: middle;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      pointer-events: none;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8));
    }
    .bone-cause-item {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }
    .bone-cause-item:hover text {
      fill: var(--yellow) !important;
      font-weight: 700;
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }
    .bone-cause-text {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      fill: #FFFFFF !important;
      dominant-baseline: middle;
      transition: fill 0.2s ease;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
    }
    body.theme-red .bone-cause-text,
    body.theme-wine .bone-cause-text {
      fill: #FFFFFF !important;
    }
    .bone-cause-dot {
      fill: var(--yellow);
      opacity: 0.85;
      transition: r 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
    }
    .bone-cause-item:hover .bone-cause-dot {
      r: 4.5;
      opacity: 1;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px var(--yellow));
    }

    /* Cabeça do peixe (Efeito SLA) */
    .fish-head-box {
      fill: #550109;
      stroke: var(--yellow);
      stroke-width: 2.5;
      rx: 12;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.25));
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    body.theme-red .fish-head-box {
      fill: #5A010A;
      stroke: var(--yellow);
    }
    body.theme-wine .fish-head-box {
      fill: #34050C !important;
      stroke: var(--yellow) !important;
    }
    .fish-head-group:hover .fish-head-box {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      stroke-width: 3;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.5));
    }

    .fishbone-legend {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .fishbone-legend {
      color: #F8CFCF;
    }
    .fishbone-legend .legend-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

            /* --- SLIDE FLUXO TO-BE --- */
    #slide-15 {
      justify-content: flex-start !important;
      padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 1.2rem) !important;
    }
    #slide-15 .slide-content-container {
      margin: 0 auto !important;
      max-width: 1540px !important;
      padding-top: 0 !important;
    }
    .flowchart-tobe-container {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .flowchart-tobe-container {
      background: rgba(75, 2, 8, 0.75);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3);
    }
    .flowchart-tobe-frame {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 64vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 6px;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .flowchart-tobe-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 62vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .tobe-legend-pills {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .tobe-pill {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .tobe-pill {
      background: rgba(50, 1, 5, 0.5);
      color: #F8CFCF;
    }
    .tobe-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .tobe-dot.blue { background: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #3B82F6; }
    .tobe-dot.green { background: #10B981; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10B981; }
    .tobe-dot.yellow { background: #F59E0B; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #F59E0B; }

    /* --- SLIDE FLUXOGRAMA AS-IS --- */
    .flowchart-asis-container {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .flowchart-asis-container {
      background: rgba(75, 2, 8, 0.75);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3);
    }
    .flowchart-img-frame {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 52vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      cursor: zoom-in;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .flowchart-img-frame img {
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 50vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .flowchart-lanes-info {
      width: 100%;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .flowchart-lanes-info {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }
    .lane-chip-item {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .lane-chip-item {
      background: rgba(50, 1, 5, 0.5);
      color: #F8CFCF;
    }
    .lane-chip-item strong {
      color: var(--yellow);
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 6: DIAGNÓSTICO (ISHIKAWA) --- */
    .ishikawa-wrapper {
      margin-top: 24px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .ishikawa-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .ishikawa-card {
      background: var(--bg-2);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
    }
    .ishikawa-card.color-yellow {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--yellow);
    }
    .ishikawa-card.color-red {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--red-alert);
    }
    .ishikawa-card:hover, .ishikawa-card.is-selected {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .ishikawa-card.color-yellow:hover, .ishikawa-card.color-yellow.is-selected {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .ishikawa-card.color-red:hover, .ishikawa-card.color-red.is-selected {
      border-color: var(--red-alert);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-red);
    }
    .ishikawa-items-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .ishikawa-items-list li {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
      padding-left: 14px;
      position: relative;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .ishikawa-items-list li::before {
      content: '•';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .ishikawa-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .ishikawa-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

        /* --- SLIDE DE PROPOSTAS & OBJETIVOS DETALHADOS --- */
    .objectives-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .objective-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .objective-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .obj-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .obj-card-header {
      border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.2);
    }
    .obj-num-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.25);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .obj-card-header h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.3;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .objective-card p {
      color: var(--text-2);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .objective-card p {
      color: #F8DCDC;
    }
    .objective-card p:last-of-type {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .obj-footer-highlight {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.08);
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.2);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .objectives-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 8: OBJETIVOS --- */
    .objectives-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
    .objective-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px 24px;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      cursor: pointer;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .objective-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .obj-num-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      opacity: 0.85;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .obj-micro-diagram {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .objectives-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* --- SLIDE NOVO: FERRAMENTAS UTILIZADAS PARA MAPEAR O PROCESSO --- */
    .tools-showcase-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.6rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .tools-showcase-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .tools-showcase-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
    .tool-item-box {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 24px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .tool-item-box:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .tool-icon-col {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.28);
      color: var(--yellow);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .tool-divider-border {
      width: 2px;
      height: 48px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      opacity: 0.8;
      border-radius: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .tool-text-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .tool-name-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .tool-desc-text {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .tool-item-box.full-width-tool {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 10: PROPOSTA & SCANNER DE IA --- */
    .proposal-scanner-box {
      background: #0E0E0E;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    .scanner-line {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--yellow), transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--yellow), 0 0 35px var(--yellow);
      animation: scanAnim 3s infinite ease-in-out;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    @keyframes scanAnim {
      0% { top: 0%; opacity: 0.2; }
      50% { top: 96%; opacity: 1; }
      100% { top: 0%; opacity: 0.2; }
    }
    .scanner-items {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .scanner-item-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 3px solid #333;
    }
    .scanner-item-row.valid {
      border-left-color: #2ecc71;
    }
    .scanner-item-row.warning {
      border-left-color: var(--yellow);
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .scanner-items { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 11: O QUE ESPERAMOS --- */
    .expectations-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 2.2rem;
    }
    .expect-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px 18px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    }
    .expect-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    .expect-value-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3);
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .expect-value-badge.pending {
      color: var(--text-2);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      font-style: italic;
    }

        /* --- SLIDE 13: CONCLUSÃO (CENTRALIZADO & ELEGANTE) --- */
    .slide-16 .slide-content-container {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .conclusao-wrap {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .conclusao-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.8vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .conclusao-divider {
      margin: 1.5rem auto 2.2rem auto;
    }
    .conclusao-divider::before {
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
    .conclusao-card-box {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 45px);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .conclusao-card-box {
      background: rgba(75, 2, 8, 0.78);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
    }
    .conclusao-card-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--yellow), var(--gold));
    }
    .conclusao-impacto-text {
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-1);
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }
    .conclusao-impacto-text strong {
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .conclusao-thanks-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.35);
      border-radius: 30px;
      padding: 10px 28px;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--yellow);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.2);
    }
    body.theme-red, body.theme-wine, body .conclusao-thanks-badge {
      background: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.2);
      color: #FFF;
      border-color: var(--yellow);
    }
    .conclusao-footer-credits {
      color: var(--text-2);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* --- SLIDE 12: CONCLUSÃO --- */
    .slide-13 .final-phrase {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4.8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 1050px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .actions-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .btn-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-action.primary {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #000;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-action.primary:hover {
      background: #ffd633;
      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.6);
    }
    .btn-action.secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .btn-action.secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--yellow);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       7. MODO OVERVIEW (VISÃO GERAL EM GRADE)
       ========================================================================== */
    .overview-modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }
    .overview-modal.is-open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .overview-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .overview-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .overview-card {
      background: var(--bg-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: var(--transition-smooth);
      position: relative;
    }
    .overview-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: var(--glow-gold);
    }
    .overview-card.is-current {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.08);
    }
    .overview-card .num-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--yellow);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .overview-card .title-tag {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       8. MODAL DE ATALHOS DE TECLADO (?)
       ========================================================================== */
    .shortcuts-modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      z-index: 1100;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .shortcuts-modal.is-open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .shortcuts-content {
      background: var(--bg-1);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    }
    .shortcut-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       9. AUTOPLAY PROGRESS INDICATOR
       ========================================================================== */
    .autoplay-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(20,20,20,0.7);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-2);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .autoplay-badge.is-playing {
      border-color: var(--yellow);
      color: var(--yellow);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       10. IMPRESSÃO (@media print - 1 slide por folha em 16:9)
       ========================================================================== */
    @media print {
      body, html {
        overflow: visible !important;
        background: #000 !important;
        color: #fff !important;
      }
      .custom-cursor, .custom-cursor-dot, .top-bar, .bottom-bar, .nav-arrow-btn, #ambient-canvas {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .presentation-viewport {
        height: auto !important;
        overflow: visible !important;
      }
      .slides-track {
        display: block !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        transform: none !important;
      }
      .slide {
        width: 100vw !important;
        height: 100vh !important;
        page-break-after: always;
        break-after: page;
        opacity: 1 !important;
        transform: none !important;
        padding: 40px !important;
        display: flex !important;
      }
    }

    /* Redução de Movimento (Acessibilidade) */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      * {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
      .slides-track {
        transition: transform 0.1s linear !important;
      }
    }
  
    /* ==========================================================================
       TEMA VERMELHO (PADRÃO / ATUAL) & TEMA VINHO (DESKTOP FIBRA ELEGANTE)
       ========================================================================== */
    body, body.theme-red {
      --bg-0: #7A010C;
      --bg-1: #8C020E;
      --bg-2: #650008;
      --bg-3: #520006;
      --bg-card: rgba(85, 3, 10, 0.72);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(115, 5, 15, 0.88);
      --yellow: #FFD43B;
      --gold: #FFC107;
      --red-dark: #3F0005;
      --red-alert: #FF4D4D;
      --text-1: #FFFFFF;
      --text-2: #FCE8E8;
      --text-muted: #E5B4B4;
      --line: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.28);
      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      --border-gold: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.45);
      --glow-gold: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
      /* Degradê gradual da esquerda para a direita inspirado na identidade gamer Desktop */
      background: linear-gradient(108deg, #500007 0%, #68010B 22%, #85020E 45%, #B30816 72%, #D8131A 92%, #EB241A 100%);
    }

    /* Variações no tema vermelho padrão */
    .global-ambient-layer {
      background: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 45%, rgba(255, 130, 20, 0.35) 0%, rgba(235, 36, 26, 0.2) 35%, transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 75% 25%, rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.22) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 0%, transparent 40%);
    }

    .topographic-lines-svg path {
      stroke: rgba(255, 225, 120, 0.28);
    }

    .top-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(80, 2, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(80, 2, 8, 0) 100%) !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.2) !important;
    }

    .bottom-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(80, 2, 8, 0.95) 0%, rgba(80, 2, 8, 0) 100%) !important;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.15) !important;
    }

    .btn-icon,
    .slide-counter,
    .autoplay-badge,
    .nav-dots-container {
      background: rgba(70, 2, 7, 0.85);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.3);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-icon:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.25);
      color: var(--yellow);
    }

    .badge {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #7A010C;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .problem-highlight-box {
      background: rgba(65, 2, 6, 0.85);
      border-left-color: var(--yellow);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .badge-chip {
      background: rgba(60, 2, 6, 0.7);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .hex-avatar-inner {
      background: #500207;
    }

    .nav-arrow-btn {
      background: rgba(75, 2, 7, 0.8);
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .nav-arrow-btn:hover {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #7A010C;
    }

    .modal-backdrop {
      background: rgba(45, 1, 4, 0.85);
    }

    .overview-card,
    .shortcuts-modal {
      background: #6B010B;
      border-color: rgba(255, 212, 59, 0.35);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       TEMA VINHO / BORDÔ ELEGANTE (DESKTOP FIBRA + CELULAR)
       ========================================================================== */
    body.theme-wine {
      --bg-0: #260509;
      --bg-1: #38080E;
      --bg-2: #4C0B14;
      --bg-3: #5E0E19;
      --bg-card: rgba(48, 7, 13, 0.78);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(72, 11, 20, 0.92);
      --yellow: #FFCC14;
      --gold: #E5AC0B;
      --red-dark: #1E0306;
      --red-alert: #FF334B;
      --text-1: #FFFFFF;
      --text-2: #F5D7DC;
      --text-muted: #D19BA4;
      --line: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.22);
      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --border-gold: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.38);
      --glow-gold: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3);
      --glow-red: 0 0 25px rgba(114, 17, 30, 0.4);
      /* Fundo Vinho Sofisticado Desktop Fibra */
      background: linear-gradient(128deg, #1C0407 0%, #2E070C 28%, #440A12 58%, #5A0E18 84%, #6E121E 100%) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .global-ambient-layer {
      background: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 40%, rgba(138, 20, 36, 0.42) 0%, rgba(90, 14, 24, 0.25) 35%, transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 70%, rgba(70, 10, 18, 0.35) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(15, 2, 4, 0.5) 0%, transparent 45%) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .topographic-lines-svg path {
      stroke: rgba(255, 215, 140, 0.22) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .top-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(32, 4, 8, 0.95) 0%, rgba(32, 4, 8, 0) 100%) !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.18) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .bottom-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(30, 4, 7, 0.96) 0%, rgba(30, 4, 7, 0) 100%) !important;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.15) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .btn-icon,
    body.theme-wine .slide-counter,
    body.theme-wine .autoplay-badge,
    body.theme-wine .nav-dots-container {
      background: rgba(42, 6, 11, 0.88) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.28) !important;
      color: #fff !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .btn-icon:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.2) !important;
      color: var(--yellow) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .badge {
      background: var(--yellow) !important;
      color: #38080E !important;
      font-weight: 800 !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .problem-highlight-box {
      background: rgba(40, 6, 11, 0.9) !important;
      border-left-color: var(--yellow) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.45) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .badge-chip {
      background: rgba(45, 6, 12, 0.75) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3) !important;
      color: #fff !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .hex-avatar-inner {
      background: #2D060C !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .nav-arrow-btn {
      background: rgba(48, 7, 13, 0.85) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3) !important;
      color: #fff !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .nav-arrow-btn:hover {
      background: var(--yellow) !important;
      color: #38080E !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .modal-backdrop {
      background: rgba(22, 3, 5, 0.88) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .overview-card,
    body.theme-wine .shortcuts-modal {
      background: #3B0910 !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.32) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .conclusao-card-box {
      background: rgba(52, 7, 14, 0.82) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.3) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .flowchart-tobe-container,
    body.theme-wine .flowchart-asis-container {
      background: rgba(35, 5, 9, 0.75) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.22) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .fishbone-svg-wrap {
      background: rgba(35, 5, 9, 0.72) !important;
      border-color: rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.22) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .bone-cat-box {
      fill: #34060C !important;
      stroke: var(--yellow) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .fish-head-box {
      fill: #34050C !important;
      stroke: var(--yellow) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .quadro-indicadores-table th {
      background: rgba(55, 8, 15, 0.85) !important;
    }

    body.theme-wine .quadro-indicadores-table td {
      background: rgba(38, 5, 10, 0.65) !important;
    }

    /* Linhas orgânicas fluidas animadas no fundo (estilo Desktop Telecom) */
    .animated-brand-curves {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
      opacity: 0.45;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .animated-brand-curves path {
      animation: waveFloat 45s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      transform-origin: center;
      will-change: transform;
    }

    .animated-brand-curves path:nth-child(2) {
      animation-duration: 55s;
      animation-delay: -12s;
    }

    .animated-brand-curves path:nth-child(3) {
      animation-duration: 65s;
      animation-delay: -25s;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 2. Partículas Douradas Sutis em Canvas -->
  <canvas id="ambient-canvas"></canvas>

  <!-- 3. Camada Global de Fundo: Gradiente Gamer -->
  <div class="global-ambient-layer">
    <div class="ambient-radial-glow"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. Barra Superior (Progresso, Identidade, Controles) -->
  <header class="top-bar">
    <div class="top-progress-bar" id="topProgressBar"></div>
    <div class="brand-meta">
      <span class="badge">SENAI</span>
      <img src="assets/desktop-logo.jpg" alt="Logo Desktop" class="brand-logo-img">
      <span>Desktop | Jurídico</span>
    </div>

    <div class="top-controls">
      <!-- Alternar Tema (Vermelho Desktop / Vinho Desktop) -->
      <button class="btn-icon" id="themeToggleBtn" title="Alternar Tema (Vermelho Desktop / Vinho Bordô)" aria-label="Alternar tema de cores">
        <i data-lucide="palette" id="themeToggleIcon" style="width:18px; height:18px;"></i>
      </button>

      <!-- Indicador Numérico -->
      <div class="slide-counter" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="current-num" id="currentSlideNum">01</span> / <span id="totalSlidesNum">18</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Botão Visão Geral (Overview) -->
      <button class="btn-icon" id="openOverviewBtn" title="Visão geral (O)">
        <i data-lucide="grid" style="width:18px; height:18px;"></i>
      </button>

      <!-- Botão Tela Cheia -->
      <button class="btn-icon" id="fullscreenBtn" title="Tela cheia (F)">
        <i data-lucide="maximize-2" style="width:18px; height:18px;"></i>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 5. Botões Flutuantes de Navegação (Setas Laterais) -->
  <button class="nav-arrow-btn prev" id="prevSlideBtn" aria-label="Slide anterior">
    <i data-lucide="chevron-left" style="width:28px; height:28px;"></i>
  </button>
  <button class="nav-arrow-btn next" id="nextSlideBtn" aria-label="Próximo slide">
    <i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:28px; height:28px;"></i>
  </button>

  <!-- 6. Viewport e Trilho dos 12 Slides -->
  <main class="presentation-viewport" id="presentationViewport">
    <div class="slides-track" id="slidesTrack">

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 1: CAPA
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide slide-1 is-active" id="slide-1" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 1 de 17: Capa">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <div class="cover-wrap">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
              <img src="assets/desktop-logo.jpg" alt="Logo Desktop" style="width: clamp(65px, 6vw, 85px); height: clamp(65px, 6vw, 85px); border-radius: 18px; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 20px rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.4); border: 2px solid rgba(255, 204, 20, 0.6); display: inline-block;">
            </div>
            <p class="top-sub">TÉCNICO EM ADMINISTRAÇÃO – <span class="highlight-yellow">SENAI</span></p>
            <h1 class="main-pcc title-large">Projeto de <span class="highlight-yellow">Conclusão</span> de Curso</h1>
            
            <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>
            
            <h2 class="subtitle-problem">JURÍDICO & CONTRATOS</h2>
            
            <div>
              <button class="scroll-hint" id="startPresentationBtn">
                <span>Deslize para começar</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 2: QUEM SOMOS?
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide" id="slide-2" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 2 de 17: Quem somos">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <p class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="users" style="width:14px; height:14px;"></i> EQUIPE DO PROJETO</p>
          <h2 class="title-large" style="margin-top: 10px;">Quem <span class="highlight-yellow">somos?</span></h2>
          <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>

          <!-- 4 Integrantes em Hexágonos -->
          <div class="team-grid" id="teamContainer">
            <!-- Gerado dinamicamente via JS/config -->
          </div>


        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 3: INTRODUÇÃO
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide" id="slide-3" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 3 de 17: Introdução">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <p class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="compass" style="width:14px; height:14px;"></i> CONTEXTO INSTITUCIONAL</p>
          <h2 class="title-large highlight-yellow" style="letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-top: 10px;">INTRODUÇÃO</h2>
          <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>

          <div class="intro-grid">
            <div class="premium-card intro-card">
              <div class="icon-box">
                <i data-lucide="wifi" style="width:28px; height:28px;"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="title-small" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Quem é a <span class="highlight-yellow">DESKTOP</span></h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                Com <strong style="color:#fff; font-size:1.3rem;" class="counter-number" data-target="30">0</strong> anos no mercado, é uma das principais operadoras de internet banda larga e fibra óptica do estado de São Paulo, conectando centenas de milhares de clientes.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="premium-card intro-card">
              <div class="icon-box">
                <i data-lucide="scale" style="width:28px; height:28px;"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="title-small" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Setor envolvido: <span class="highlight-yellow">Jurídico</span></h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                Área estratégica responsável pelo compliance, mitigação de riscos contratuais, validação legal e formalização de parcerias com fornecedores e clientes corporativos.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="premium-card intro-card">
              <div class="icon-box">
                <i data-lucide="graduation-cap" style="width:28px; height:28px;"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="title-small" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Papel do <span class="highlight-yellow">SENAI</span></h3>
              <p style="color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.05rem;">
                Foco no estímulo ao aprendizado prático dos alunos do curso Técnico em Administração e na proposição de soluções concretas e inovadoras para as problemáticas da DESKTOP.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 4: DOR RELATADA
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide" id="slide-4" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 4 de 17: Dor Relatada">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <p class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="alert-triangle" style="width:14px; height:14px;"></i> INTRODUÇÃO / DESAFIOS</p>
          <h2 class="title-large highlight-yellow" style="margin-top: 10px;">DOR RELATADA - Solicitação de Parecer Jurídico</h2>
          <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>

          <div class="problem-highlight-box">
            <span class="marker-highlight">Gargalos</span>, 
            <span class="marker-highlight">idas e vindas</span> dos chamados entre as áreas, 
            <span class="marker-highlight">documentos incompletos</span>, 
            ausência de documentação e <span class="marker-highlight">falta de padronização</span> no atendimento. Para então propor melhorias e tornar o fluxo mais ágil e padronizado.
          </div>

          <div class="problem-chips-grid">
            <div class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="repeat" style="width:16px; height:16px; color:var(--yellow);"></i> Retrabalho excessivo entre áreas</div>
            <div class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="file-question" style="width:16px; height:16px; color:var(--yellow);"></i> Minutas sem checklist padrão</div>
            <div class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="clock" style="width:16px; height:16px; color:var(--yellow);"></i> Tempo de espera prolongado</div>
            <div class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="alert-circle" style="width:16px; height:16px; color:var(--red-alert);"></i> Risco de perda de prazos comerciais</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 5: MAPEAMENTO DO PROCESSO
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide" id="slide-5" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 5 de 17: Mapeamento do Processo">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <p class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="git-merge" style="width:14px; height:14px;"></i> LEVANTAMENTO & IMERSÃO</p>
          <h2 class="title-large" style="margin-top: 10px;">Mapeamento e Diagnóstico dos <span class="highlight-yellow">Processos</span></h2>
          <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>

          <div class="mapping-grid">
            <!-- Item 1 -->
            <div class="mapping-card">
              <div class="mapping-icon-wrap">
                <i data-lucide="briefcase" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="mapping-card-content">
                <h3>Alinhamento Técnico com o Jurídico</h3>
                <p>Realização de reuniões com a advogada <strong>Winnie Prudente</strong>, do setor Jurídico, para compreender os processos atuais e identificar gargalos e oportunidades de melhoria.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 2 -->
            <div class="mapping-card">
              <div class="mapping-icon-wrap">
                <i data-lucide="messages-square" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="mapping-card-content">
                <h3>Entrevistas com Solicitantes e Equipe</h3>
                <p>Entrevistas com colaboradores do Jurídico e das demais áreas solicitantes, identificando dificuldades na comunicação, nos prazos, nas informações e na padronização das solicitações.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 3 -->
            <div class="mapping-card">
              <div class="mapping-icon-wrap">
                <i data-lucide="file-search" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="mapping-card-content">
                <h3>Análise e Definição de Prioridades</h3>
                <p>Análise detalhada das informações coletadas para identificar as causas raízes dos problemas operacionais e definir prioridades estratégicas de atuação.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 4 -->
            <div class="mapping-card">
              <div class="mapping-icon-wrap">
                <i data-lucide="sparkles" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="mapping-card-content">
                <h3>Propostas de Melhoria Customizadas</h3>
                <p>Desenvolvimento de propostas de melhoria práticas e inovadoras, alinhadas às necessidades dos colaboradores e à realidade do setor.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
           SLIDE 6: FLUXO ATUAL (AS-IS)
           ========================================== -->
      <section class="slide" id="slide-6" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 6 de 17: Fluxo Atual AS-IS">
        <div class="slide-content-container">
          <p class="badge-chip"><i data-lucide="git-branch" style="width:14px; height:14px;"></i> MAPEAMENTO DE PROCESSO EM RAIAS</p>
          <h2 class="title-large" style="margin-top: 10px;">Fluxo Atual: <span class="highlight-yellow">Seção AS-IS</span></h2>
          <p style="color:var(--text-2); font-size:1.05rem; margin-top:4px;">
            Mapeamento ponta a ponta das solicitações de parecer jurídico e análise de contratos entre as 4 raias organizacionais:
          </p>
          <div class="brand-divider-line"></div>

          <div class="flowchart-asis-container">
            <div class="flowchart-img-frame" onclick="window.open('assets/fluxograma-as-is.jpg', '_blank')" title="Clique para ampliar em tela cheia">
              <img src="assets/fluxograma-as-is.jpg" alt="Fluxograma AS-IS do Processo de Solicitação de Parecer Jurídico" loading="lazy">
            </div>

            <div class="flowchart-lanes-info">
              <div class="lane-chip-item">
                <i data-lucide="user" style="color:var(--yellow); width:16px; height:16px;"></i>
                <span><strong>Raia 1:</strong> Solicitante</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lane-chip-item">
                <i data-lucide="scale" style="color:var(--yellow); width:16px; height:16px;"></i>
                <span><strong>Raia 2:</strong> Jurídico</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lane-chip-item">
                <i data-lucide="briefcase" style="color:var(--yellow); width:16px; height:16px;"></i>
                <span><strong>Raia 3:</strong> Diretor CC</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lane-chip-item">
                <i data-lucide="file-check" style="color:var(--yellow); width:16px; height:16px;"></i>
                <span><strong>Raia 4:</strong> Contratos</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==========================================
